sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as You (phone)
  participant A as The agent (Pie)
  participant F as The program's source
  participant S as npm run apply
  participant M as Service manager
  U->>A: "add a page for my workouts"
  A->>F: read · edit · write
  A->>S: bash: npm run apply -- "workouts page"
  S->>S: check: types, build, boot test
  alt the check fails
    S-->>A: the errors (nothing applied)
    A->>F: fix, and apply again
  else it passes
    S->>F: git commit
    S-->>A: "applied, restarting in a second" (now in the log)
    S->>M: the process ends
    M->>M: starts the new version
    Note over A: Pie resumes the run from the log, on the new code
    A-->>U: "done: the page is there" · the open page reloads
  end
